UI -> CTRL : 2. getListOfPubTypes()
CTRL -> SVC : 3. nomeFuturoMetodo()

SVC --> CTRL : 4. pubTypeList
CTRL --> UI : 5. pubTypeList
UI --> User : 6. Here's the list

@enduml
